Vaporwave, a theme for RiftWii: a striped sunset over a neon grid that
rolls toward you, behind dark violet glass with hot pink and cyan.

To the extent possible under law, the author has waived all copyright and
related or neighboring rights to this theme (theme.ini and every PNG
picture in its folder), under Creative Commons CC0 1.0 Universal:
https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/

The pictures, including the looping backdrop's 20 frames, were drawn by a
short Python script from arithmetic alone: no source images, textures or
fonts. The theme keeps RiftWii's own sounds.

Third-party parts:

- music.ogg: "chill wave friday sept 17" by Alex McCulloch (Pro Sensory),
  CC0 1.0, from https://opengameart.org/content/chill-wave-friday-sept-17
  The author asks to be credited by name: thank you, Alex McCulloch.
  Converted from the original MP3 to Ogg Vorbis (quality 4), otherwise
  unchanged.
